Qwen3.8-Flash-Next memory patch 01: embed_tokens and lm_head only where used.

vllm/models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/model.py

Qwen4ExpModel built embed_tokens and Qwen4ExpForCausalLM built lm_head on
every pipeline rank. Only the first rank embeds tokens and only the last rank
computes logits, so with PP=3 each rank carried an unused INT8 copy of one or
both 248320 x 2560 tables, 0.60 GiB each. They are now PPMissingLayer on the
other ranks, as in the other vLLM models. The weights loaded per rank on
3 x RTX 3090 go from 21.58 / 21.55 / 21.55 to 20.98 / 20.44 / 21.05 GiB, and
nothing is computed differently.

